WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, February, Zinger

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
queen

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:12.530
Why did you expose yourself to attack?

00:01:13.060 --> 02:01:37.060
AZALEA

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:15.760
There he is!

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:25.840
Let's forget about distancing today.

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:33.080
Your Majesty.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:35.320
Are you okay?

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:51.900
Who's there?

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:11.620
We're leaving, heading out.

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:15.860
Episode 9

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:45.190
I let them sleep separately
to rest in peace,

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:49.520
but it seems I was a little mistaken.

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:52.590
I heard something break.

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:54.390
I also woke up because of the noise.

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:56.600
And the door was broken.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.200
The matter is clearly unclean, everything needs to be examined.

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:03.240
But then we will interrupt the royal couple.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:13.620
I wouldn't be surprised if because of them
the house will shake.

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.820
Newlyweds, what to take from them.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:20.020
We must protect their privacy.

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:25.190
Don't get too close to the house.

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:26.690
Yes.

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:32.200
I'll go to the annex.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:33.930
Will you protect their peace?

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:37.370
-Yes.
-Take care of them.

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:21.750
Control yourself, woman!

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:30.020
And you had to kiss him?!

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:35.160
Are you looking for a fight?

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:39.170
Who are you arguing with?

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.170
Don't interfere.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:44.200
This is just between me and Kim Soyeon.

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:47.740
While I'm here

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:49.610
I will do what I want with this body.

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:52.080
Whose soul is in the body is the owner!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.650
Apparently you're still drunk.

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:01.020
You don't see the difference between a dream and reality.

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:04.660
-I have a stone in my soul.
-What are you talking about?

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.740
Yes, I'm in any condition
I can walk home on my own two feet.

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:28.280
No. This is not a dream.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:31.990
Why would you show up in my dream?

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:36.660
Sorry for showing up

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:40.330
in your dreams.

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:05.420
Forget this nightmare.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.520
Episode 9: Light and Darkness

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:40.340
Hong Young, it's ticklish.

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:15.040
She's not here. If she is not in the house, then where?

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.210
Is something wrong?

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:24.850
It wasn't because of the past that he was worried.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:22.440
-Hey, hey.
-What?

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:23.980
They told me not to come near the house.

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:25.810
-Why?
-Don't know.

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:28.310
-Sit down.
-Fine.

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:32.950
To be honest, I'm worried about Her Majesty.

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:34.090
Have you heard anything about her?

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:36.190
About the queen?

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:37.220
She runs around the palace

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:38.290
every morning.

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:40.530
Don't talk nonsense.

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:43.900
I have known her since infancy.
She never ran when she was born.

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:46.730
-You're lying.
-It's true.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:51.040
-And it’s strange.
-But that's what they say.

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:52.770
-No.
-I don’t believe it!

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:53.870
I'm telling the truth.

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:58.980
-Chickens!
-Grab them.

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:02.820
Stop, feathered one!

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:20.830
He wore the clothes of the Detective Department.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:22.970
So...

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:38.720
You'll get so drunk. Stop.

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:42.790
Thirst torments.

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:45.620
The more I think what a sin it is,
the more I thirst.

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:50.760
It's like I'm dying of thirst.

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:54.370
If you're thirsty, drink water, not wine.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:01.140
Hey there, bring us some water.

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:02.740
Yes.

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:10.020
The more wine you drink, the more you want to drink.

00:12:27.570 --> 00:12:30.440
I slept so well, as if someone had knocked me out.

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:35.010
I understand you.

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:37.580
The body was filled with lightness.

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:40.580
You. You.

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:49.360
This house must have been built on good soil. I had a great night's sleep.

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:52.860
Is it normal that you wake up with me?

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:58.760
Is this abnormal?

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:01.470
This is not a palace - you don’t choose the date of your night together.

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:03.870
Naturally, in our father’s house we share the same bed.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:06.440
Logical.

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:08.740
You have to be in the camp of the enemy
with me is the best cover.

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:11.480
Your game today is top class.

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:15.820
Okay, let's pretend
that we spent a hot night together.

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:18.720
It was so hot that we turned it over...

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:26.090
What?

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:27.990
It seems you remember this night.

00:13:28.230 --> 00:13:29.860
It would be a pity if you forgot her

00:13:29.860 --> 00:13:31.460
like our first one.

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:34.230
Is it because the memory has returned?

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:39.040
I sleep like a baby.

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:54.550
I have no time to play tricks.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:57.890
You need to become the queen dowager's ace.

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:00.590
Even if something happens to the Han family,

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.130
They can't reach me.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:07.030
The masked man and I were looking for the same thing.

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:10.000
How much does Kim Byungin already know?

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:13.540
The accounting book should not fall into their hands.

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:19.810
Today I will return to the palace no matter what.

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:24.250
Today I will find the book no matter what.

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:36.160
You can get sick that way.

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:39.330
When does the queen return to the palace?

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:43.540
I will send word so that they are with His Majesty
returned as soon as possible.

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:47.010
I never found life in the palace boring.

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:50.180
But the queen has only been gone for a couple of days,
and here it’s already desolate.

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:54.380
Is Her Majesty's cooking so exquisite?

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:57.820
It's not about her cooking.
She's nice to me.

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:02.450
Attachment is dangerous.

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:05.190
This morning I was hungry...

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:06.630
That is

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:10.660
I woke up early, missing my dear queen.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.360
I understand you.

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:15.070
It's scary to realize that you've been tamed.

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:21.470
It seems like you're the one using others

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:25.040
but at some point it turns out that you have been tamed.

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:29.180
Therefore, you must find more people who are useful to you.

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:33.790
I will order the royal chefs
learn Her Majesty's recipes.

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:38.290
You made my life in the palace a paradise.

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:40.890
I have no reason to leave him.

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:43.830
That's why I ended up in my place -

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.700
to guard this paradise, Your Majesty.

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:51.640
By the way.

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:54.710
Tell Benin to come see me sometimes.

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:58.010
Do you want

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:00.980
talk to him?

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:04.180
After all, he is your adopted son.
I've neglected him enough.

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:07.490
It's time to give him instructions from time to time.

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:10.660
You're still not getting any younger.

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:12.730
Do only important things.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:15.960
Everything that concerns you is important to me.

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:55.800
What are you doing?

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:02.810
Detective department

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:05.280
will check each of the king's guards.

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:09.010
You protect the life of the king and are always by his side -

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:12.790
we must make sure of everything.

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:16.860
Don't let them take a step!

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:29.100
Every person here has passed

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:31.870
full check.

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.580
You can also buy a pedigree.

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:40.250
You never know.

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:42.480
Someone from the guard

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:44.520
may be preparing treason under someone else's name.

00:17:45.820 --> 00:17:48.190
Provide assistance - we are doing our duty.

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:54.960
If you do not find evidence of your accusations,

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:57.560
I

00:17:59.030 --> 00:18:01.000
I will now use my powers.

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.770
That is if you save your post.

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:07.970
If you are not involved in treason, move away.

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:19.720
-Look everywhere.
-Yes.

00:18:32.530 --> 00:18:33.830
Search every corner.

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:36.870
Seize all documents.

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:38.600
And bring it to the Detective Department.

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:39.940
-Yes!
-Yes!

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:57.320
Hope you slept well.

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:01.060
I brought a beautiful bird.

00:19:01.060 --> 00:19:02.160
How do you like her?

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.930
She has beautiful plumage.

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:08.830
This precious bird makes me happy in the light of the good news.

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:15.340
Got some good news?

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:17.810
Enmity between the queen and

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:20.450
Royal Concubine Cho is even stronger than I thought.

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:23.780
There's something I didn't tell you.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:26.750
Nobody knows about this.

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:28.650
Just me and the queen.

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:36.160
Because of what happened 8 years ago, Her Majesty is confident

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:39.360
that I stole the king from her.

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:44.240
The poison on our arrow is getting stronger.

00:19:44.970 --> 00:19:47.970
It's time to use the second thing.

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:49.040
Yes.

00:19:50.110 --> 00:19:52.850
It's hard to find something as similar

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:55.610
this will take me some time.

00:19:56.480 --> 00:20:00.120
But I'll bring it to you
even if you have to make it yourself.

00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:14.770
Use this one.

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:34.190
They will know about the royal guard in no time.

00:20:34.720 --> 00:20:36.150
Let's find a way.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:38.520
Yesterday you ran into a man from the Detective Department.

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:40.660
He saw your face. Will this be a problem?

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:43.330
I don't think he recognized me.

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:46.470
If we collide again

00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:49.840
he will understand that I was looking for the ledger.

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:57.910
He was wearing a rare mask in the form of a tokkebi.

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:02.510
Did he have a scar?

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:05.650
Yes. It looks like an old scar.

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:07.920
He is one of those who tortured Ovol.

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:11.820
So Kim Jwageun

00:21:11.820 --> 00:21:13.930
acted through Kim Byonin.

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:16.300
Fortunately,

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:19.830
he does not know that the location of the ledger has changed.

00:21:21.930 --> 00:21:23.640
Tonight is our last chance.

00:21:26.270 --> 00:21:28.940
Your Majesty, there is a letter for you from the palace.

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:34.650
This letter is from Kim Jwageun.

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:38.220
He was delivered by the head of the Detective Department.

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:41.550
Anyone from this department

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:42.920
could easily deliver it.

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:44.320
But did you personally complain?

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:46.790
Do you have a lot of free time?

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:50.630
I brought it personally because it's important.

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:54.430
Your Majesty and the Queen are asked to return to the palace immediately.

00:21:55.900 --> 00:21:57.900
Troop commander

00:21:57.900 --> 00:22:00.040
demands that I return to the palace?

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:03.480
He delivers a message from the Queen Dowager.

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:07.380
I will stay here another night for the queen's health.

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:08.680
-Tell them.
-But...

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:09.920
That's all.

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:13.590
Don't disturb the queen's peace and come back.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:19.120
Here's how.

00:22:21.630 --> 00:22:26.630
It seems His Majesty is very concerned about the Queen's health.

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:31.570
That's what I'll tell you.

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:39.480
I will have breakfast in the queen's room.

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:42.150
Bring your usual breakfast. Just let it be easy.

00:22:42.150 --> 00:22:43.320
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:22:43.320 --> 00:22:46.050
We will serve our usual breakfast.

00:22:50.060 --> 00:22:51.890
Concubine Cho's house is nearby,

00:22:52.160 --> 00:22:53.860
I'll find out about Ovol and come back.

00:22:53.860 --> 00:22:55.160
Great idea.

00:22:56.130 --> 00:22:58.260
I felt bad after sending her away.

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:00.670
And I won’t be in the palace for another night.

00:23:00.670 --> 00:23:02.600
Please keep an eye on her.

00:23:03.200 --> 00:23:04.240
Yes.

00:23:11.380 --> 00:23:15.950
The Queen hung around here all day long. But when she was gone,

00:23:16.850 --> 00:23:19.820
the royal kitchen seems so empty.

00:23:25.160 --> 00:23:27.160
Now I can breathe again.

00:23:31.100 --> 00:23:34.230
You scoundrel. More rapeseed oil.

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:35.500
Here's the armless one.

00:23:35.830 --> 00:23:37.370
Cut it smaller.

00:23:38.340 --> 00:23:40.440
Cook quickly before it loses its shape.

00:23:48.410 --> 00:23:52.820
How nice and peaceful it is here.

00:23:53.150 --> 00:23:55.490
I love being in charge.

00:24:01.660 --> 00:24:09.300
-Royal cook!
-Royal cook!

00:24:09.300 --> 00:24:13.040
-Royal cook!
-Royal cook!

00:24:13.040 --> 00:24:14.340
- Yes, that's enough.
-Royal cook.

00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:15.410
-Royal cook.

00:24:18.010 --> 00:24:19.740
-Come back.
- We obey.

00:24:20.110 --> 00:24:21.350
Court lady Choi.

00:24:24.280 --> 00:24:25.520
Court lady Choi.

00:24:27.220 --> 00:24:29.250
Looking at your face

00:24:30.260 --> 00:24:33.560
I realized that the queen had not yet recovered.

00:24:34.090 --> 00:24:37.700
No, she made a full recovery.

00:24:39.530 --> 00:24:41.930
Then why were they lowered into the water?

00:24:43.970 --> 00:24:48.770
I've been through so much lately thanks to Her Majesty.

00:24:50.310 --> 00:24:52.180
I thought when she wasn't around,

00:24:52.810 --> 00:24:54.650
I won't have to find fault

00:24:55.250 --> 00:24:57.080
and I will feel calmer.

00:24:57.820 --> 00:24:58.950
But in reality, how?

00:25:00.320 --> 00:25:01.990
I'm going even more crazy.

00:25:02.820 --> 00:25:07.390
I'm scared to death that without me she'll get completely out of hand.

00:25:07.690 --> 00:25:11.200
Here's the deal. They say that there are much more worries about unheard rumors,

00:25:11.200 --> 00:25:13.300
than about kind kids.

00:25:14.100 --> 00:25:15.630
Stop moping.

00:25:15.770 --> 00:25:16.970
Here.

00:25:25.840 --> 00:25:27.850
Open.

00:25:34.790 --> 00:25:36.020
Picked it up along the way.

00:25:38.220 --> 00:25:41.690
On days like these

00:25:41.690 --> 00:25:45.160
you're like mine, but no.

00:25:45.160 --> 00:25:48.330
On days like these

00:25:48.330 --> 00:25:51.540
you're like mine, but no.

00:25:51.670 --> 00:25:53.740
And days like these you are like mine, but not.

00:25:53.740 --> 00:25:56.070
And why did he give me the garbage he picked up?

00:25:57.080 --> 00:25:58.840
What a nightmare.

00:25:59.810 --> 00:26:01.780
The more I get to know him, the stranger it seems.

00:26:02.710 --> 00:26:04.650
He could have just thrown it away, why did he give it to me?

00:26:04.980 --> 00:26:06.590
This is rubbish.

00:26:07.180 --> 00:26:10.980
Have you received news from Ovol?

00:26:11.650 --> 00:26:12.650
No.

00:26:13.250 --> 00:26:14.920
Did something happen to her?

00:26:16.690 --> 00:26:18.720
She didn't return home.

00:26:20.620 --> 00:26:23.590
I think she went somewhere else because she felt guilty towards you.

00:26:23.990 --> 00:26:26.660
I asked around about her. Don't worry too much.

00:26:27.700 --> 00:26:29.560
I told her so many times, but she again...

00:26:29.730 --> 00:26:32.070
I'm looking for your gift for her.

00:26:33.540 --> 00:26:36.670
If she went to another place, she had to sell it.

00:26:37.870 --> 00:26:39.240
I'm scared

00:26:40.080 --> 00:26:41.780
that I will lose all my people.

00:26:44.580 --> 00:26:47.020
When will the king return to the palace?

00:26:47.480 --> 00:26:48.550
He will stay

00:26:49.550 --> 00:26:50.720
for one more night.

00:26:53.760 --> 00:26:55.360
It's not what you think.

00:26:55.960 --> 00:26:57.890
I can't tell you the details

00:26:57.890 --> 00:27:01.000
but tonight everything will be resolved.

00:27:02.200 --> 00:27:03.830
It's not that the king has

00:27:04.800 --> 00:27:07.470
many other worries

00:27:08.300 --> 00:27:10.610
his feelings for me have changed.

00:27:12.240 --> 00:27:16.540
Apparently, I'm the only one clinging to childhood memories.

00:27:17.210 --> 00:27:19.050
I remember how I returned to the capital

00:27:19.910 --> 00:27:22.880
and met you and the king two years ago.

00:27:23.350 --> 00:27:26.020
Even if that day was the first time he saw you,

00:27:28.160 --> 00:27:29.190
for sure

00:27:30.190 --> 00:27:31.890
I would love it.

00:27:35.860 --> 00:27:39.170
Your words encourage me.

00:27:47.980 --> 00:27:49.980
What is your usual breakfast?

00:27:50.950 --> 00:27:53.650
I need to get better.
Why do you need to hang around here another night?

00:27:53.950 --> 00:27:56.850
To take care of you, my queen.

00:27:57.890 --> 00:27:59.950
Doctors treat, pharmacists give medicine.

00:28:00.120 --> 00:28:02.490
And the king cares about politics,
and not about my health.

00:28:02.920 --> 00:28:04.790
Do you know how much people suffer?

00:28:04.790 --> 00:28:08.530
You speak the true truth, queen.

00:28:08.530 --> 00:28:10.530
So come on, make some turtle soup

00:28:10.530 --> 00:28:11.900
and go to work as a king.

00:28:12.700 --> 00:28:14.570
Don't neglect the turtle's sacrifice.

00:28:16.170 --> 00:28:18.010
Rather than accept her sacrifice, I'd rather go

00:28:18.370 --> 00:28:21.480
I'll see how ordinary people live.

00:28:22.880 --> 00:28:24.550
I'll be back late

00:28:25.680 --> 00:28:27.080
which means you have to stay another night.

00:28:30.290 --> 00:28:32.090
Don’t you want to hang around in the palace either?

00:28:32.750 --> 00:28:35.160
It’s terrible that you feel even worse there than at your relatives’ house.

00:28:37.730 --> 00:28:40.900
Yes, it's nice and cozy here.

00:28:43.330 --> 00:28:45.330
What kind of person is the Queen Dowager?

00:28:45.530 --> 00:28:47.800
She is Mr. Kim Jwageun's sister

00:28:47.840 --> 00:28:51.370
and has not left the palace since she arrived.

00:28:51.370 --> 00:28:53.240
What if I present to someone who never

00:28:53.240 --> 00:28:55.940
did not leave the palace, dishes from outside...

00:28:55.940 --> 00:28:57.010
You know...

00:28:57.610 --> 00:29:00.320
In historical dramas, they always eat gukbap.

00:29:00.320 --> 00:29:01.450
What does it taste like?

00:29:02.280 --> 00:29:04.850
How can I know the taste of such simple food?

00:29:18.300 --> 00:29:19.870
Not that amazing.

00:29:22.700 --> 00:29:25.440
What you miss
can become a terrible weapon.

00:29:32.150 --> 00:29:34.080
They made a broth from beef brisket and white radish,

00:29:34.080 --> 00:29:36.080
seasoned with soybean paste and heated the rice with it.

00:29:37.320 --> 00:29:39.590
It has a lot of meat. Modest, but it has its own charm.

00:29:40.220 --> 00:29:42.420
Kimchi made from radish
no salted seafood,

00:29:42.420 --> 00:29:44.260
because everything goes well together without overwhelming the taste.

00:29:44.560 --> 00:29:46.690
It is said that Hongjong always ate gukbap outside the palace.

00:29:50.600 --> 00:29:51.930
Damn it.

00:29:52.570 --> 00:29:55.440
The neighbor ran away without paying taxes,
I have to pay for it.

00:29:55.600 --> 00:29:57.310
This is a real robbery.

00:29:57.410 --> 00:29:58.770
Bite your tongue.

00:29:59.140 --> 00:30:00.810
Do you want to be beaten with sticks?

00:30:00.810 --> 00:30:03.080
I'll die biting my tongue

00:30:03.080 --> 00:30:05.850
or I’ll run away and become a bandit - there are two options.

00:30:05.850 --> 00:30:09.120
Bite your tongue? Yes, I have nothing to lose!

00:30:09.220 --> 00:30:12.890
They peel off like sticky stuff. Where is the king looking?!

00:30:13.620 --> 00:30:15.060
What did you want?

00:30:15.060 --> 00:30:17.130
Of course, he rips off.

00:30:17.130 --> 00:30:19.390
A puppet who was given a throne to close

00:30:19.390 --> 00:30:22.000
for all to see, and they did what they wanted.

00:30:22.000 --> 00:30:23.430
Crap.

00:30:27.500 --> 00:30:29.240
Stop.

00:30:32.110 --> 00:30:33.640
I overheard you.

00:30:33.940 --> 00:30:36.440
You've been through a lot.

00:30:38.180 --> 00:30:41.850
People die because of a stupid king.

00:30:42.780 --> 00:30:45.390
Drink and forget your sorrows.

00:30:46.390 --> 00:30:48.690
You look alike

00:30:48.690 --> 00:30:51.060
for a person of high position.

00:30:54.000 --> 00:30:55.300
Pretending to be an aristocrat.

00:30:56.230 --> 00:30:58.130
The most expensive thing was the pedigree.

00:30:58.130 --> 00:31:01.370
Without clothes and pedigree, I am an ordinary beggar.

00:31:04.040 --> 00:31:05.910
Young people today look great

00:31:05.910 --> 00:31:08.240
but in reality they are dummies like you.

00:31:08.310 --> 00:31:09.340
How dare you?

00:31:10.080 --> 00:31:11.880
Yes, our country is a dummy.

00:31:11.880 --> 00:31:14.820
If people had something inside them,
They would have taken that away too.

00:31:16.280 --> 00:31:17.790
Funny.

00:31:18.290 --> 00:31:20.560
This gentleman

00:31:20.560 --> 00:31:23.560
- an interesting way of looking at things.
-Funny.

00:31:23.560 --> 00:31:26.630
A man from a family of traitors became king.

00:31:26.630 --> 00:31:28.860
Everything is completely rotten.

00:31:28.860 --> 00:31:30.870
Where has it been seen that a person from a family

00:31:30.870 --> 00:31:34.000
who for generations committed treason,

00:31:34.000 --> 00:31:36.100
became a king?

00:31:36.100 --> 00:31:39.410
What was the king thinking when accepting the throne?

00:31:39.970 --> 00:31:41.880
He lives in the power of the Kims,

00:31:41.880 --> 00:31:44.810
who cowardly killed his entire family.

00:31:44.810 --> 00:31:45.950
That's it.

00:31:46.080 --> 00:31:48.580
-Crap.
-And that’s true.

00:31:48.580 --> 00:31:50.620
You have crossed the line.

00:31:52.520 --> 00:31:55.060
You are free to curse the king,

00:31:57.860 --> 00:32:00.660
but don't you dare discuss his family!

00:32:00.700 --> 00:32:03.060
There is a line that cannot be crossed!

00:32:03.870 --> 00:32:05.000
Do you think

00:32:05.100 --> 00:32:07.070
Does being a king mean living a luxurious life?

00:32:07.070 --> 00:32:09.040
He is constantly afraid of being poisoned

00:32:09.040 --> 00:32:10.440
or headless. This is cruel!

00:32:10.640 --> 00:32:12.810
Are you from the palace?

00:32:12.940 --> 00:32:15.510
Are you representatives of the king?

00:32:15.710 --> 00:32:17.010
Who are you?

00:32:17.310 --> 00:32:19.480
I? Yes I am

00:32:23.380 --> 00:32:24.890
from the King's fan club.

00:32:25.590 --> 00:32:26.960
-What?
-What is this?

00:32:28.860 --> 00:32:30.020
Fan club?

00:32:30.160 --> 00:32:31.990
Antifans are fans too.

00:32:32.290 --> 00:32:35.930
Okay, at least one more time discuss his family,

00:32:36.060 --> 00:32:38.730
I'll turn the table over for you!

00:32:39.130 --> 00:32:42.400
-Did you miss it?
-Okay, okay.

00:32:42.400 --> 00:32:44.040
Don't come near!

00:32:44.040 --> 00:32:45.170
Sorry.

00:32:45.270 --> 00:32:46.840
Count us in!

00:32:46.840 --> 00:32:48.240
Come here.

00:32:48.240 --> 00:32:50.880
Come on.

00:32:51.180 --> 00:32:53.080
Well, character.

00:32:53.080 --> 00:32:54.650
Let me go. Let go.

00:32:55.080 --> 00:32:56.820
I wasn't upset.

00:32:58.320 --> 00:32:59.690
You said you were pretending.

00:33:00.190 --> 00:33:01.990
You couldn't reveal yourself.

00:33:01.990 --> 00:33:03.260
I got angry instead of you.

00:33:09.630 --> 00:33:10.930
What? Well?

00:33:12.100 --> 00:33:13.870
You are a wonderful actress.

00:33:14.840 --> 00:33:17.010
Do you even know what this means?

00:33:17.710 --> 00:33:19.170
Isn't it something good?

00:33:20.210 --> 00:33:22.540
By the way, what is a fan club?

00:33:24.210 --> 00:33:26.310
These are noble people

00:33:26.310 --> 00:33:28.620
who wish someone happiness

00:33:28.620 --> 00:33:29.950
and success from the bottom of my heart.

00:33:30.890 --> 00:33:32.790
It's like a spiritual guide.

00:33:34.790 --> 00:33:36.090
What about anti-fans?

00:33:37.730 --> 00:33:38.790
Let me think.

00:33:39.660 --> 00:33:43.160
Someone who is more interested in this person than a fan?

00:33:45.200 --> 00:33:47.040
More influential mentor.

00:33:48.640 --> 00:33:51.810
I don't deserve your feelings for me.

00:33:54.280 --> 00:33:56.280
Give it up. If I'm deposed

00:33:56.280 --> 00:33:57.850
I will sell kukpap.

00:33:58.610 --> 00:33:59.780
Don't say that.

00:34:00.650 --> 00:34:02.480
I won't let this happen.

00:34:03.450 --> 00:34:05.390
I'm also your anti-fan.

00:34:05.690 --> 00:34:08.320
Certainly. Calmed me down.

00:34:09.660 --> 00:34:11.560
Now we go in different directions.

00:34:11.560 --> 00:34:13.060
We have different goals.

00:34:14.430 --> 00:34:17.770
Where is a good restaurant?
where do people line up?

00:34:20.840 --> 00:34:23.170
“An” means convenient, “ti”...

00:34:24.340 --> 00:34:25.370
fan?

00:34:26.610 --> 00:34:29.240
I thought I had done well enough in my studies.

00:34:29.940 --> 00:34:31.410
There is something to work on.

00:34:35.450 --> 00:34:37.450
-Try it.
-God.

00:34:37.450 --> 00:34:38.990
-Many.
-God.

00:34:38.990 --> 00:34:41.020
-Buy it, madam.
-Try it.

00:34:41.020 --> 00:34:43.690
-Buy it.
-What are you doing?

00:34:43.690 --> 00:34:45.490
Delicious, I guess.

00:35:03.910 --> 00:35:05.780
Scared me, what are you doing?

00:35:05.780 --> 00:35:08.120
You'll go into a back alley in expensive clothes,

00:35:08.120 --> 00:35:09.550
you will become a target.

00:35:10.650 --> 00:35:12.420
-Which target?
-Who do we have here?

00:35:12.420 --> 00:35:14.360
What have such rich people forgotten here?

00:35:15.460 --> 00:35:17.130
This is what I was talking about.

00:35:17.430 --> 00:35:19.960
Move away. I don't want to hurt you.

00:35:21.400 --> 00:35:22.630
Do you like the girl?

00:35:22.630 --> 00:35:24.370
In vain.

00:35:24.870 --> 00:35:27.300
And don't even dream

00:35:27.300 --> 00:35:29.600
that I'm here alone.

00:35:30.470 --> 00:35:32.170
I've noticed this before.

00:35:32.170 --> 00:35:35.710
You express yourself so awkwardly
like an educated robber.

00:35:36.310 --> 00:35:38.110
-Be polite.
-Yeah.

00:35:38.110 --> 00:35:40.980
Don't worry, I won't give you any offense.

00:35:41.980 --> 00:35:44.420
I'm your anti-fan.

00:35:47.360 --> 00:35:48.560
What did he say?

00:35:56.900 --> 00:35:58.230
Scared.

00:35:59.270 --> 00:36:00.970
Wherever I am

00:36:00.970 --> 00:36:02.600
You should not walk in remote places.

00:36:04.410 --> 00:36:05.870
Take care of them, Cheoljong.

00:36:11.280 --> 00:36:13.250
And if something happens to him,

00:36:14.650 --> 00:36:16.420
will history change?

00:36:17.620 --> 00:36:21.860
Hey! I'm from the special forces!

00:36:24.460 --> 00:36:25.590
Already lost?

00:36:28.560 --> 00:36:29.600
Cheoljong.

00:36:30.570 --> 00:36:31.700
Are you dead?

00:36:34.070 --> 00:36:35.840
How can I get home?

00:36:35.840 --> 00:36:38.370
Wow, why does a rich lady...

00:36:39.170 --> 00:36:41.780
I thought she came back because she was worried about me.

00:36:42.440 --> 00:36:44.580
And you just don’t know the way home.

00:36:45.050 --> 00:36:46.580
What about those thugs?

00:36:47.180 --> 00:36:50.080
They ran after the guy in more expensive clothes.

00:36:51.450 --> 00:36:54.490
Don't worry, I won't give you any offense.

00:36:55.620 --> 00:36:58.060
I'm your anti-fan.

00:37:01.300 --> 00:37:02.530
What did he say?

00:37:03.560 --> 00:37:06.270
Our time is not so peaceful

00:37:06.270 --> 00:37:08.870
to turn your back.

00:37:08.870 --> 00:37:11.010
I think you understand what you've gotten yourself into.

00:37:11.440 --> 00:37:13.240
Come on. Just a poem.

00:37:14.180 --> 00:37:16.140
From the Qing Empire?

00:37:16.140 --> 00:37:18.480
It's beautiful if we sell it,
we can eat for five days.

00:37:18.480 --> 00:37:19.550
Come on, take it off.

00:37:26.690 --> 00:37:28.960
Don't turn your back.

00:37:33.900 --> 00:37:35.260
I didn't kill him.

00:37:37.060 --> 00:37:39.330
But I’ll definitely kill the next one who rushes.

00:37:49.380 --> 00:37:52.150
Why is he on earth?

00:37:52.750 --> 00:37:54.080
I just had too much to drink.

00:37:59.790 --> 00:38:01.920
You are very lucky.

00:38:04.960 --> 00:38:06.230
What about your clothes?

00:38:06.990 --> 00:38:10.060
I can't go unnoticed

00:38:10.060 --> 00:38:11.900
in expensive clothes.

00:38:16.870 --> 00:38:17.970
What are you doing?

00:38:17.970 --> 00:38:19.970
Need to buy something.

00:38:19.970 --> 00:38:21.980
She left in a hurry and didn’t take the money.

00:38:22.780 --> 00:38:25.310
-Great.
-You are robbing a robber.

00:38:25.580 --> 00:38:27.620
Hey, no.

00:38:27.980 --> 00:38:31.490
Show me. It's not fair to take everything for yourself.

00:38:35.560 --> 00:38:37.360
Eat kukpapa.

00:38:41.000 --> 00:38:42.030
Here you go.

00:38:43.200 --> 00:38:45.730
- Let's go.
-What do you want to buy?

00:38:51.870 --> 00:38:52.870
Continue.

00:38:55.110 --> 00:38:57.210
He fought skillfully.

00:38:57.950 --> 00:38:59.610
Judging by the way he guarded the room,

00:39:00.380 --> 00:39:02.120
I think the item exists.

00:39:02.120 --> 00:39:04.750
Will you be able to recognize him if you meet him again?

00:39:05.920 --> 00:39:07.720
Certainly. Mister,

00:39:09.620 --> 00:39:11.030
I need medicine.

00:39:16.760 --> 00:39:18.570
I made it clear.

00:39:19.100 --> 00:39:21.370
There is no cure if you fail.

00:39:21.800 --> 00:39:23.300
How will you repay me?

00:39:23.840 --> 00:39:26.010
Will you give your hand to be cut off?

00:39:26.440 --> 00:39:28.010
I'll repay you.

00:39:29.640 --> 00:39:30.980
I swear on my life.

00:39:43.560 --> 00:39:45.430
Here! Guess what it is.

00:39:45.660 --> 00:39:48.430
Moon vessel from the Goryeo Dynasty.

00:39:48.860 --> 00:39:51.330
Seriously? It's such a value.

00:39:51.730 --> 00:39:53.630
-What is the price?
-It's a fake copy.

00:39:54.770 --> 00:39:57.100
Buy it if you plan to use it to protect yourself again.

00:39:58.640 --> 00:40:00.170
Here's a crook.

00:40:07.920 --> 00:40:09.050
Choose one.

00:40:13.420 --> 00:40:14.490
I bet everything.

00:40:15.090 --> 00:40:18.730
Wow, you can’t bet that much money.

00:40:18.730 --> 00:40:20.760
This is a capitalist society
where money wins.

00:40:21.000 --> 00:40:22.500
- I'll bet everything.
-Sorry.

00:40:22.500 --> 00:40:23.960
-What are you doing?
-My lady.

00:40:23.960 --> 00:40:25.070
Madam.

00:40:25.070 --> 00:40:26.700
-Open it.
-Open it.

00:40:28.940 --> 00:40:31.910
Such a fraudster must have
his gang is near the table.

00:40:32.370 --> 00:40:36.010
I'm sure all the spectators are there for
to invite you into the game.

00:40:37.040 --> 00:40:39.680
You were born a king.

00:40:39.680 --> 00:40:42.450
And it still seems
you know the streets up and down.

00:40:42.920 --> 00:40:45.620
And he denied it with all his might.

00:40:51.030 --> 00:40:52.760
This is my weak point.

00:40:56.500 --> 00:40:58.570
My family was destroyed under the pretext of treason.

00:40:59.870 --> 00:41:01.000
Prince Ganghwado.

00:41:02.340 --> 00:41:05.210
My family history is my weakness,
which destroys me.

00:41:08.210 --> 00:41:09.740
Do you have nightmares about

00:41:09.740 --> 00:41:11.410
How do you get scolded in court, or what?

00:41:14.250 --> 00:41:17.950
A real nightmare is not what I dream.

00:41:19.590 --> 00:41:21.260
A real nightmare...

00:41:28.330 --> 00:41:29.800
Why did you stop mid-sentence?

00:41:30.800 --> 00:41:32.700
I forgot what I was going to say.

00:41:32.700 --> 00:41:33.730
Actually

00:41:35.370 --> 00:41:37.540
I wanted to ask you a question.

00:41:39.910 --> 00:41:41.910
Why didn't you tell anyone about that night?

00:41:43.540 --> 00:41:45.850
-About what?
-That I tried to hurt you.

00:41:47.080 --> 00:41:50.420
Oh, are you talking about this? I don't want to get into this mess.

00:41:50.790 --> 00:41:54.090
I just want to slide past all the difficulties.

00:42:06.170 --> 00:42:09.640
If only our country would become peaceful,
to be idle already.

00:42:10.770 --> 00:42:13.640
Saving the country is not my thing at all.

00:42:16.610 --> 00:42:17.650
There you go.

00:42:17.650 --> 00:42:20.580
I would like to stand up and greet you.

00:42:20.580 --> 00:42:22.980
Yes, I slept in the cold mountains,

00:42:22.980 --> 00:42:24.790
my whole body hurts.

00:42:25.450 --> 00:42:27.250
If I had stayed there one more night,

00:42:27.250 --> 00:42:29.020
my lovely lips would go numb.

00:42:29.960 --> 00:42:31.930
-Have you finished?
-What are you talking about?

00:42:32.290 --> 00:42:33.760
Your whining.

00:42:33.760 --> 00:42:35.530
And a little bragging.

00:42:35.860 --> 00:42:37.360
I still have a lot of things

00:42:37.360 --> 00:42:39.900
but I'll stop here -
It seems you have something important to do.

00:42:41.500 --> 00:42:44.270
OK. What's there?

00:43:08.960 --> 00:43:12.900
I heard you make the best masks.

00:43:15.600 --> 00:43:16.840
Pick something there.

00:43:22.110 --> 00:43:23.540
Wow, teethers...

00:43:27.010 --> 00:43:28.720
I don't want a regular mask.

00:43:29.080 --> 00:43:32.290
I'm thinking of selling to officials
unique masks.

00:43:32.620 --> 00:43:33.720
Unique?

00:43:37.560 --> 00:43:42.130
Lately you seem like mine

00:43:42.130 --> 00:43:44.060
and at the same time no.

00:43:47.130 --> 00:43:48.300
Pour water.

00:43:49.600 --> 00:43:51.110
Pour water.

00:43:51.540 --> 00:43:52.540
Yes!

00:43:53.940 --> 00:43:55.140
-Royal cook.
-Yes?

00:43:56.380 --> 00:43:59.810
The Dowager Queen wants a late snack.

00:44:01.750 --> 00:44:04.250
But I'm not sure you can do it.

00:44:05.090 --> 00:44:06.290
How are you...

00:44:07.620 --> 00:44:09.820
I've been working in the royal kitchen for 30 years,

00:44:09.820 --> 00:44:12.030
and 12 of them as a royal chef.

00:44:12.730 --> 00:44:15.660
How can I be worse than the queen?
Sooner is better.

00:44:23.840 --> 00:44:25.470
I trust you completely.

00:44:42.660 --> 00:44:44.430
Crap. Again.

00:44:55.170 --> 00:44:56.200
Again.

00:45:18.090 --> 00:45:19.590
Faster.

00:45:25.430 --> 00:45:26.530
This is all?

00:45:27.870 --> 00:45:31.770
I milked all the cows in the barn.

00:45:31.940 --> 00:45:35.210
There is not a drop of milk left.

00:45:36.010 --> 00:45:37.180
Nonsense!

00:45:39.750 --> 00:45:40.750
What?

00:45:44.750 --> 00:45:46.550
You're an armless asshole.

00:46:02.340 --> 00:46:03.570
Your Majesty.

00:46:09.380 --> 00:46:11.650
I suddenly became so angry, everything infuriates me.

00:46:11.810 --> 00:46:13.180
Not this confused body

00:46:13.180 --> 00:46:14.580
nothing lying around like a dead man,

00:46:14.580 --> 00:46:15.980
don't feel like me.

00:46:16.050 --> 00:46:19.350
I don't even know, my name is Chan Soyeon
or Kim Bong Hwan.

00:46:19.650 --> 00:46:21.820
Well, your memory has returned,

00:46:21.820 --> 00:46:23.220
so you are confused.

00:46:24.990 --> 00:46:26.760
Do you know what I hate most?

00:46:27.530 --> 00:46:29.360
I'm getting used to this body.

00:46:30.430 --> 00:46:31.970
That I feel comfortable in a skirt now.

00:46:42.840 --> 00:46:45.510
You're probably on your period.
I'll get you some pads.

00:46:50.580 --> 00:46:51.620
I have

00:46:52.750 --> 00:46:54.190
menstruation?

00:47:09.900 --> 00:47:11.070
Court Lady Jeon!

00:47:11.570 --> 00:47:13.370
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:47:14.140 --> 00:47:16.710
Why hasn't the queen returned to the palace yet?

00:47:16.980 --> 00:47:19.410
I'll send another letter now.

00:47:19.410 --> 00:47:21.180
We're not at war.

00:47:21.450 --> 00:47:23.320
Send it as soon as it's light.

00:47:23.320 --> 00:47:24.950
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:47:28.220 --> 00:47:31.660
Is my brother's word no longer as powerful?

00:47:33.730 --> 00:47:36.760
Old age is a vice.

00:47:41.640 --> 00:47:42.940
How hungry I am.

00:48:00.950 --> 00:48:02.290
Another.

00:48:09.300 --> 00:48:10.600
There is no one.

00:48:11.330 --> 00:48:13.030
Mr. Hon.

00:48:23.840 --> 00:48:25.510
It's you. Come in.

00:48:27.110 --> 00:48:29.220
Waiting for my return?

00:48:29.780 --> 00:48:31.920
How did you know that I just returned?

00:48:33.890 --> 00:48:34.890
Hey.

00:48:35.520 --> 00:48:36.590
Wait a minute.

00:48:38.630 --> 00:48:41.530
How did you get so wasted in 2 days?

00:48:41.600 --> 00:48:43.260
Mr. Hon.

00:48:44.800 --> 00:48:46.870
Have you lost all your money to the crooks?

00:48:47.130 --> 00:48:48.770
Or have you lost your house documents?

00:48:48.900 --> 00:48:51.770
I was 14 then, I was naive.

00:48:52.570 --> 00:48:54.510
This problem is more serious.

00:48:55.080 --> 00:48:56.440
Lost your documents for the site?

00:48:56.440 --> 00:48:58.480
This already happened when I went...

00:49:01.210 --> 00:49:03.180
Your family also suffered from misfortunes.

00:49:05.220 --> 00:49:08.220
Family or love?

00:49:09.590 --> 00:49:11.560
That's the question.

00:49:17.200 --> 00:49:19.800
Poor guy.

00:49:19.870 --> 00:49:22.940
You poor thing.

00:49:23.670 --> 00:49:25.510
This is truly a serious problem.

00:49:36.070 --> 00:49:38.540
Your Majesty. Dowager Queen

00:49:38.540 --> 00:49:40.520
calls you quickly to the Dongmyeongjong hall.

00:49:54.730 --> 00:49:56.070
Did you call me?

00:49:56.790 --> 00:49:59.500
You don't believe that you're to blame

00:49:59.500 --> 00:50:02.130
in the death of the late king, right?

00:50:03.480 --> 00:50:07.400
So you do your best
to blame my family.

00:50:08.210 --> 00:50:09.210
Your Majesty.

00:50:09.820 --> 00:50:13.250
You can insult me any way you like.

00:50:13.650 --> 00:50:16.110
but take care of our late king.

00:50:16.210 --> 00:50:18.860
Again you are hiding behind my son.

00:50:19.560 --> 00:50:23.560
Incredible, you have enough shamelessness
blame someone to hide guilt.

00:50:26.270 --> 00:50:29.000
A person must know himself

00:50:29.290 --> 00:50:32.770
not to commit
same errors twice.

00:50:35.230 --> 00:50:39.310
Thank you for the lesson.

00:50:46.790 --> 00:50:51.110
I'm so tired that I can't take off my socks.

00:50:56.500 --> 00:50:59.670
I'll be happy to take them off for you.

00:51:18.190 --> 00:51:20.320
Cart Day is coming soon.

00:51:21.590 --> 00:51:24.710
At this time my patience will end.

00:51:48.480 --> 00:51:49.610
I'm back.

00:51:50.420 --> 00:51:51.420
Yes.

00:51:53.480 --> 00:51:56.190
I heard that the Detective Department had a lot to do today.

00:51:56.560 --> 00:51:58.620
They say you opposed the royal guards.

00:51:58.790 --> 00:52:02.000
There were suspicions. I wanted to find
evidence before telling you.

00:52:02.000 --> 00:52:04.690
There are suspicious people among the royal guards.

00:52:04.690 --> 00:52:06.820
I think there are seven of them.

00:52:07.790 --> 00:52:09.270
Did you know about them?

00:52:12.770 --> 00:52:15.630
Do you think I didn't touch them because I didn't know about them?

00:52:19.840 --> 00:52:23.110
If you are interested in them directly, how will they react?

00:52:23.270 --> 00:52:25.690
They will dig a deeper hole and lie to the bottom.

00:52:25.920 --> 00:52:29.110
They will become smarter and act secretly.

00:52:29.150 --> 00:52:32.630
What can be seen is not a threat.

00:52:32.880 --> 00:52:37.000
Make them believe that you don't see them.

00:52:37.060 --> 00:52:39.400
And then you can kill them right away,

00:52:39.400 --> 00:52:41.670
as soon as they become a problem.

00:52:42.840 --> 00:52:44.290
I didn't think about it.

00:52:45.860 --> 00:52:47.440
Do you think

00:52:48.040 --> 00:52:50.380
the king is in this position simply because

00:52:50.380 --> 00:52:52.070
that he has no abilities?

00:52:53.770 --> 00:52:57.940
The reason is that I personally instilled fear in his mind.

00:52:58.540 --> 00:53:01.480
It is easy to control those who are afraid.

00:53:01.710 --> 00:53:04.480
If the one above is afraid of me,

00:53:04.480 --> 00:53:07.090
my power exceeds his.

00:53:09.500 --> 00:53:14.130
I will turn to you with questions concerning the king.

00:53:17.590 --> 00:53:18.940
Go get some rest.

00:54:15.730 --> 00:54:17.460
They won't be able to find you there.

00:54:17.690 --> 00:54:19.290
I will definitely come back for you.

00:54:19.500 --> 00:54:22.630
But until then, don't go out for anything.

00:54:22.630 --> 00:54:25.170
What about my brothers? And you, mom?

00:54:25.170 --> 00:54:26.810
I'm fine as long as you're alive.

00:54:27.500 --> 00:54:30.500
You are my only son.

00:54:31.710 --> 00:54:32.900
If you die

00:54:34.000 --> 00:54:35.340
I can't live either.

00:54:36.980 --> 00:54:38.070
Faster!

00:54:56.130 --> 00:54:57.130
Faster!

00:56:30.230 --> 00:56:31.590
It seems so to me.

00:56:32.460 --> 00:56:33.670
This is unrealistic.

00:56:35.860 --> 00:56:37.040
We need to find the accounting book.

00:56:45.110 --> 00:56:46.270
Am I wrong?

00:56:47.310 --> 00:56:48.380
Impossible.

00:56:55.690 --> 00:56:57.460
I'm innocent, Wonbeom!

00:56:58.110 --> 00:57:02.230
I was falsely accused. Son, I can't rest.

00:57:02.230 --> 00:57:05.020
Wonbom! Wonbom!

00:57:05.020 --> 00:57:06.290
-It wasn't me.
-Wonbom.

00:57:06.290 --> 00:57:08.900
-Wonbom.
-Wonbom.

00:57:08.900 --> 00:57:11.670
-Only you survived.
-Unfair.

00:57:12.340 --> 00:57:14.940
It's all a lie.

00:57:15.230 --> 00:57:17.440
It's only in my head.

00:57:17.630 --> 00:57:20.150
-No no.
-I curse you.

00:57:20.150 --> 00:57:22.440
-No.
-I curse you.

00:57:46.960 --> 00:57:48.070
Kim Soyeon.

00:57:53.670 --> 00:57:55.520
What? So similar.

00:57:56.440 --> 00:58:00.320
Do you think you will become like the real Kim Soyeon?

00:58:00.650 --> 00:58:03.360
They have something in common: no mothers.

00:58:09.500 --> 00:58:13.360
This book was written by a scholar from Joseon.

00:58:13.360 --> 00:58:14.360
Initial Instruction for Children
Kim Soyeon

00:58:14.360 --> 00:58:16.130
Five types of relationships:

00:58:16.690 --> 00:58:19.610
father - son, ruler - subject, husband - wife,

00:58:20.000 --> 00:58:21.460
older brother, younger brother,

00:58:21.460 --> 00:58:23.170
each other.

00:58:23.170 --> 00:58:26.000
You study so hard that you wear out the book.

00:58:26.840 --> 00:58:28.310
Why are you repeating it again?

00:58:29.840 --> 00:58:33.110
Today is my mother's funeral.

00:58:33.920 --> 00:58:35.710
This is her book.

00:58:36.860 --> 00:58:39.860
So that's what you do when you miss your mom.

00:58:42.020 --> 00:58:43.250
I cried

00:58:43.820 --> 00:58:47.130
Until I found a way to see my mother.

00:58:47.900 --> 00:58:49.000
Which?

00:58:49.900 --> 00:58:53.210
If I die, I will see her.

00:59:27.040 --> 00:59:28.130
Alive?

00:59:30.810 --> 00:59:32.270
Did you come to die too?

00:59:33.810 --> 00:59:35.000
What are you talking about?

00:59:35.820 --> 00:59:37.340
I came here to die.

00:59:43.090 --> 00:59:46.630
Do you want to live? Because you're afraid to die?

00:59:51.250 --> 00:59:52.270
No.

00:59:53.460 --> 00:59:57.090
Everyone dies except me. That's what's scary.

00:59:58.500 --> 00:59:59.610
Then

01:00:01.110 --> 01:00:02.400
let's die together.

01:00:16.560 --> 01:00:18.150
Let's do this on the count of three.

01:00:19.060 --> 01:00:20.090
Yes.

01:00:31.090 --> 01:00:32.810
The sound is coming from here!

01:00:37.110 --> 01:00:38.230
Brother?

01:00:38.540 --> 01:00:40.150
Do you know how worried I was?

01:00:40.650 --> 01:00:42.940
The whole family was looking for you.

01:00:42.940 --> 01:00:45.170
Brother.

01:00:51.610 --> 01:00:52.880
I'll come down to you.

01:00:55.290 --> 01:00:56.920
Just lower the ladder.

01:00:57.520 --> 01:00:58.590
Fine.

01:01:05.460 --> 01:01:08.500
Sorry. But I still want to live.

01:01:10.810 --> 01:01:12.750
You also want to live, right?

01:01:18.710 --> 01:01:20.210
I'll come back.

01:01:27.480 --> 01:01:28.750
If you want to live

01:01:29.630 --> 01:01:33.460
if you want to live again, then give it back to me.

01:01:47.150 --> 01:01:49.170
-Can you reach it?
-Yes.

01:02:02.590 --> 01:02:03.690
Dad.

01:02:06.130 --> 01:02:07.420
Please.

01:02:07.420 --> 01:02:10.290
Mrs. Soyeon.

01:02:17.230 --> 01:02:21.310
Dad, please. Daddy.

01:02:21.310 --> 01:02:25.020
Daddy! Please!

01:02:25.020 --> 01:02:28.250
Dad, daddy!

01:02:28.250 --> 01:02:29.590
-Please.
-Lay the well.

01:02:29.920 --> 01:02:34.630
Dad, no! No need, dad!

01:02:34.630 --> 01:02:37.360
Dad! Don't do this!

01:02:40.460 --> 01:02:42.000
No! Dad!

01:02:42.540 --> 01:02:46.630
No need, dad! No need!

01:02:47.130 --> 01:02:50.070
Please, dad! Don't do this!

01:02:50.630 --> 01:02:53.400
Dad, no! Daddy!

01:02:53.570 --> 01:02:56.150
Dad!

01:03:03.560 --> 01:03:05.090
Both mom and this girl.

01:03:05.820 --> 01:03:08.060
I still didn't believe their promises.

01:03:09.500 --> 01:03:11.060
It will all end when I die.

01:03:11.730 --> 01:03:14.590
It won't end until the well is filled with water.

01:03:16.440 --> 01:03:17.540
Never.

01:03:47.590 --> 01:03:49.440
Save me!

01:03:50.000 --> 01:03:53.360
Save, save me!

01:03:53.570 --> 01:03:55.840
Save! Please!

01:03:55.980 --> 01:03:59.170
Sorry! Please save me!

01:03:59.170 --> 01:04:00.440
It's my fault.

01:04:00.840 --> 01:04:02.670
He will die because of me.

01:04:02.670 --> 01:04:05.040
Because I revealed the secret.

01:04:05.040 --> 01:04:07.710
I told the maid about him.

01:04:07.920 --> 01:04:09.690
Did you hear what the adults said?

01:04:10.320 --> 01:04:11.610
His family are traitors.

01:04:11.960 --> 01:04:14.320
But he didn't do anything.

01:04:14.750 --> 01:04:17.590
Brother, you're a good person, aren't you?

01:04:18.150 --> 01:04:21.320
Please, brother.

01:04:29.110 --> 01:04:31.040
Come here quickly.

01:04:39.980 --> 01:04:42.460
My brother is truly a good person.

01:04:54.520 --> 01:04:56.940
Save. Save me.

01:04:57.000 --> 01:05:00.040
Please. Save.

01:05:09.820 --> 01:05:10.980
We need to hurry.

01:05:20.480 --> 01:05:21.880
You really are back.

01:05:23.250 --> 01:05:24.920
As promised.

01:06:17.270 --> 01:06:18.540
I want to live.

01:06:19.610 --> 01:06:20.650
So are you.

01:06:27.730 --> 01:06:29.520
Kim Soyeon

01:06:48.310 --> 01:06:50.070
People are afraid of the dark

01:06:50.610 --> 01:06:53.190
so they turn on the light.

01:07:08.090 --> 01:07:09.790
Secret

01:07:16.200 --> 01:07:17.980
But the brighter the light,

01:07:18.810 --> 01:07:20.610
the blacker the shadow.

01:07:37.620 --> 01:07:40.530
Hwajin.

01:08:20.610 --> 01:08:22.110
What happened?

01:08:22.110 --> 01:08:24.330
That's right, I almost touched him.

01:08:26.040 --> 01:08:27.150
It was dangerous.

01:08:27.150 --> 01:08:29.040
You could come whenever you wanted.

01:08:29.040 --> 01:08:31.370
But you can't act as you want.

01:08:31.370 --> 01:08:32.520
I'm sure it's fake.

01:08:32.520 --> 01:08:34.210
You say someone faked their identity?

01:08:34.210 --> 01:08:36.950
I will defeat one enemy with the help of another.

01:08:36.950 --> 01:08:39.190
This is how I will become indispensable:

01:08:39.190 --> 01:08:41.490
Korean food and Korean self-care.

01:08:41.490 --> 01:08:44.120
Fear and anxiety take away your sanity.

01:08:44.120 --> 01:08:46.230
You really are my anti-fan.

01:08:46.230 --> 01:08:48.900
I was worried about a lot of things, but I found a way out.
